# Input

```scss
@mixin frames {0%{opacity:0}100%{opacity:1}}
.sentinel {color:red}

```


# Formatted

```scss
@mixin frames {
	0% {
		opacity: 0;
	}
	100% {
		opacity: 1;
	}
}
.sentinel {
	color: red;
}

```
